letely on each refresh.\n+\tbool custom_icons_enabled = p_tree->nodes.size() <= 512;","path":"editor/debugger/editor_debugger_tree.cpp","commit_id":"49d26c34812bc1767bb4c58f956836e328bacf74","original_commit_id":"c49d8127e8dbb4a7877952101f1a6ec75d9a5372","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I can't reproduce issue #102525 on my machine—the provided MRP runs smoothly for me. For reference, *Brotato* runs with over 4,000 nodes, and I believe that's a perfectly reasonable scene complexity. A limit of 512 essentially disables custom icons for all non-demo games, which limits the usefulness of custom icons.\r\n\r\nIf even 800 nodes can cause slowdown, then I think this limit is highly dependent on the user's hardware configuration, and there might not be a one-size-fits-all value. Perhaps we should provide a toggle to let users disable it manually.\r\n","created_at":"2025-05-27T05:02:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T05:02:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106829#discussion_r2108168604","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi